Disclaimer: This benchmark is not a deployment-readiness certification. It
is intended to evaluate aggregate model behaviour on patient-style maternal
and reproductive health questions, not to make individual clinical decisions.
Any real-world deployment of models evaluated on Sakhi requires additional
safety validation, regulatory and ethics review, and ongoing monitoring.
